<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="COL" style="id">- Alago Bible Translation Project</book>
  <para style="h">Okolosi</para>
  <para style="toc1">Okpa ko Obulus da Ase ko Okolosi</para>
  <para style="toc2">Ase ko Okolosi</para>
  <para style="toc3">Okl</para>
  <para style="mt2">Okpa ko Obulus da</para>
  <para style="mt1">Ase ko Okolosi</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="COL 1" />
  <para style="s">Ogbogba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 1:1" />Oshu bwabo ko Obulus oyikoko ko Oyesu Okristi ipu koyoya ko Owuso kpo Otimoti oyene kaha, <verse eid="COL 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 1:2" />gebe ka ayene neshi ni hagye loshu ipu ko Okristi ogya ko Okolosi ni: Owuso Ada kaha na yala oneshi na ki dala omene!<verse eid="COL 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Inarigwu Kotunehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 1:3" />Ashotunehe do Owuso, ni wa Ada ka Adole Oyesu Okristi, ipu ki inarigwu ni aba ta ikweyi kala ni. <verse eid="COL 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 1:4" />Ikweyi koni apwela kotuse kala ipu ko Oyesu Okristi kpi imu ni ala gbo dase ko Owuso kpiri ni, <verse eid="COL 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 1:5" />Otuse kpi imu ni bose bwiyitagye na yi tagye dala ipu kiso kweyi ala kwobonu pwoshu nu ipu kela ko okwokwoshi, ko oshu neshi <verse eid="COL 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 1:6" />ni wa dala ni. Ipu kese kpiri oshu neshi mani ya gwa ki ya gye, byoni owe ipu kala bweno ni ala pwo ki gyo oneshi ko Owuso ipu ko okwokwoshi nu kpiri ni. <verse eid="COL 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 1:7" />Ala fu bwebe ke Epafara moshi ni awayole dudu ni, ohagye loshu ipu koko ko Okristi okwunu kaha, <verse eid="COL 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 1:8" />anu ni ki kela daha ikweyi kimu yoya kala ipu ko Omaku ni. <verse eid="COL 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 1:9" />Mani oni, bweno ni apwela ikweyi kala ni, aha bipu ko tinarigwu dala ki ba kado Owuso na yala shini ala nwu kpo ozagyogye kotu nu bwebe koziyi ko Omaku kpo ogyogye nu. <verse eid="COL 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 1:10" />Kweyi aha tinarigwu shini ala yawu owe ni ya sha Adole otu owe kpiri ni: Ko gwa ipu koko neshi, ki gye ipu ko ozagyogye ko Owuso, <verse eid="COL 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 1:11" />Ala hagye loshu kposhu kala kpiri byoni oshu ki igyashi nu we ni shini ala zotu ki gbotumene <verse eid="COL 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 1:12" />kweyi shotunehe da Ada, ni yala shu ko rogwu kpawase neshi ipu kobula kebe yoyu ni. <verse eid="COL 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 1:13" />Koni ongmaha shoshu kebe dibu kweyi byaha gobula koyi gotu nu, <verse eid="COL 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 1:14" />ipu nu angmaha, ayozalabi kaha rigbaha.<verse eid="COL 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ase ni Okristi We ni Kpoko Nu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 1:15" />Okristi sayi ko Owuso ni aba ma lo ni, Oyi kikyikyo, ni shoko kabo ko Owuso kpiri ni. <verse eid="COL 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 1:16" />Bwebe nu Owuso yojoji kpiri, ipu kiso kpo okpagye, oni iyi ma ni kpo oni iyi ma lo ni, ebe, kwo oshu, kwa awose, kwa awoshu kpiri; ayojoji kpiri bwebe nu ki danu. <verse eid="COL 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 1:17" />Okristi yaba kwobonu dojoji kpiri, kweyi ojoji kpiri baba dudu ipu nu. <verse eid="COL 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 1:18" />Anu pi wikweyi kikpiye nu ni wole ko Owuso ni; anu pi wotu ko olayi kikpiye la, owikyikyo ki wo Oyi kikyikyo ipu kawase ni nyiso bwikwu ni, shini ona gboshu ikweyi ko oza kpiri. <verse eid="COL 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 1:19" />Koni osho Owuso otu ko miyinu gyogya ipu ko Oyesu. <verse eid="COL 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 1:20" />Kweyi bwebe nu Owuso ya kwikye ojoji wobutu nu, koza kese koza kiso, ko byomene wa bwebe koyi nu ni shonu ikweyi ko oshi sepa ni. <verse eid="COL 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 1:21" />Ishi oye ala lenu kpo Owuso ki womonyekwotu nu ikweyi kozabibi ni ala ba ya ni. <verse eid="COL 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 1:22" />Anani ke okwikye ala wobutu nu bwebe kikpiye ko Okristi owe kikwu shini ona byala webe nu byawine kotu sere, ni gbofo lo ake ba kwuwepwo lo ni. <verse eid="COL 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 1:23" />Owoni ala gohobu ipu ko otuse kala, ki hagye giri, gbo shaga shiyitagye kala ni ala pwo ipu koshu neshi ni lo. Omani pi woshu neshi ni ala pwo ni aki ka doza kpiri ni Owuso ya ese mani, ni ami Obulus woyole nu ni.<verse eid="COL 1:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Oko ko Obulus Dase ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 1:24" />Anani nyya shotunehe ipu ko owe moma hin ikweyi kala, nki ya yimu shini ipu kikpiye hin na gohobu ko mowe ko Okristi dikpiye nu, ni wase ko Okristi ni. <verse eid="COL 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 1:25" />Nwwoyole nu bwebe koleho ni Owuso tun ko kela ko Owuso gyogye dala ni. <verse eid="COL 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="COL 1:26" />Oza ni oyi teba dawoyi nekye ni shigbo ni, anani Owuso yi gwa dawa ase nu. <verse eid="COL 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="COL 1:27" />Owuso gbo ko yoza ni teba ni gwa dawase ni wase ko Oyahuda lo ni mo, Okristi yipu wo, oya yipu kigyashi ko Owuso. <verse eid="COL 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="COL 1:28" />Aba tono dananoho. Aba pyase akpaha ki ba fuwoza kpoziyi wonyonya ni agbo ni, shini ana byananoho wobutu ko Owuso byase ni kwobonu gye ipu ko Okristi ni. <verse eid="COL 1:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="COL 1:29" />Ozani ya ni nyya yoko ni oma, ya takirikwu kpo oshu nu kpiri, ni ya yoko ipu hin ni.<verse eid="COL 1:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="COL 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 2:1" />Nyya yimu shini ala gyedo ko takirikwu nwashika ni nyya ya ikweyi kala kpa awase ni bwo Olawudikiya, kpa awase ni gyiyi kpa ami wa lo ni. <verse eid="COL 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 2:2" />Nyya mani ko tuwotugbagba shini ana bagye dudu ipu ki imu, shini ana gbogyogye nwashika, shini ana gyoza teba ko Owuso, ni wo Okristi abiyinu ni, <verse eid="COL 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 2:3" />ni ayo olashiko koziyi kpogyogye kpiri yi teba ipu nu ni. <verse eid="COL 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 2:4" />Nkela mani dala shini ashishe naka gyalegya kpawashu kokwunu lonye lo. <verse eid="COL 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 2:5" />Koni Nyyo kpala ipu kikpiye lo ni, Nyyo kpala ipu ko omaku, Nyya shotunehe kpoza yoya kala ni ala hagye loshu ipu kotuse kala ipu ko Okristi ni.<verse eid="COL 2:5" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olayi Gyogya Ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 2:6" />Byoni ala zo Oyesu Okristi wa Adole ni, ala gohobu ko gboso. <verse eid="COL 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 2:7" />Ala yogba kala na hagye loshu ipu nu, ki hagye loshu ipu ko otuse byo ni afala ni, kweyi ala nwonwu kpo otunehe. <verse eid="COL 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 2:8" />Ala ka yashishe na gyalegya kpo ogyogye kokame kasuse lo, ni bwese mani, oke wa ko Okristi lo. <verse eid="COL 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 2:9" />Ikweyi koni Owuso kpiri-kpiri yagye ipu ko Okristi, ipu kikpiye nu kasuse, <verse eid="COL 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 2:10" />kweyi adalo Okristi kpiri-kpiri, ni woteyi kawose kposhu kpiri ni. <verse eid="COL 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 2:11" />Ipu ko Okristi ala le byawase ni ashuwofu ni, wa kasuse la lo, ke wo ni Okristi yaya ni la, shini ana ngmala shoko kikpiye kozalabi, <verse eid="COL 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 2:12" />koni ishini ayala Obatisma ni, ayala nyi kpanu pini yoma. Ala ki nyiso kpanu bwebe ko otuse ipu ko oshu ko Owuso, ni shiyi bwamiri ni. <verse eid="COL 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 2:13" />Ishi oye ala gekwu ipu ko ozalabi kala kweyi bikpiye ni ya yala ba yozalabi ni, Owuso ke yala shiyi kpo Okristi. Oyozalabi kala kpiri rigbala, <verse eid="COL 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 2:14" />oyenena kepwo labi kaha bya, kpawono nu, ni yikweyi kaha ni; oyi bize, ga yigwo boshi sepa. <verse eid="COL 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 2:15" />Oyoshu kawose bize; ogbuwowuru iyi kananoho, ogwuwagye ikweyi ko oshi sepa.<verse eid="COL 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 2:16" />Mani oni ala ka yashishe na kwalepwo ikweyi ko oza ni ala ba re kwoza ni ala ba gwa, kwe ikweyi kimya sere, kwe imya ko oya pepe, kwe Eno ko Minyo lo. <verse eid="COL 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 2:17" />Awoza mani kpiri woyi kawoza ni bawa ni shishi la: Oza kotata ke wo Okristi. <verse eid="COL 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 2:18" />Ala ka yawino yikweyi bagye kokame kpo geyagye da ayoleho na walobi ko pyabola lo. Edo kasuse mani ya yotu nu kpiri doza ni oma ni, kweyi otulabi nu yo ya zikweyi iso. <verse eid="COL 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 2:19" />Oyebe lenu kpo Okristi ni wikweyi kikpiye ni, ni bwebe nu ikpiye kpiri gbayi bwebe kigo kikpiye kpanyakpa, kweyi ya gye byoni Owuso ya yimu ni.<verse eid="COL 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olayi Pepe ipu ko Okristi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 2:20" />Byoni ala gekwu kpo Okristi ni, ala kabo kposhu ka awomaku kese ni gboshu ikweyi kala ni, ojiyala ba ya byala tayayo wa kese? Ojiyala ki ba ko ono nu kwikyikyeni byo: <verse eid="COL 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 2:21" />&lt;&lt;Ka bi lo! Ka mama lo! Ka gabo anu lo!&gt;&gt; <verse eid="COL 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 2:22" />Kpiri kawoza mani ishini ayoko kpawa kweyi aba gboko kelo, ikweyi koni awono kpoza fofu kasuse ni. <verse eid="COL 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 2:23" />Edo kawono mani le byo agboziyi ipu wa ni, ikweyi koni aba yase ya geyagye dayoleho ki ya yikweyi bagye kokame, kpowe ko dikpiye. Ake gboshu ko tase abo ko shimu kiyo kese bita lo.<verse eid="COL 2:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="COL 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 3:1" />Owuso shaliyi bwikwu wo olayi kpo Okristi ni, ala yotu kala sawoza ni biso, ebe ni Okristi yagye abore ko Owuso ni. <verse eid="COL 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 3:2" />Ala yotu kala sawoza ni biso ni, woza kese mani la lo. <verse eid="COL 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 3:3" />Koni ala kwobonu gekwu wa, kweyi anani olayi kala teba kpo Okristi ipu ko Owuso. <verse eid="COL 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 3:4" />Ishini Okristi, ni wo olayi kala ni bose, ala ba bose kpanu mamani ipu kigyashi nu.<verse eid="COL 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Olayi Nekye Kpo Olayi Pepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 3:5" />Mani oni, ala yojoji ni wi imu kikpiye kala ni yi ngmo, awoza mani wo: eba boba, inyi, imu kiyi, imu ki ikpiye, kpimu kiyo kese, kpa afuyoya (afuyoya kpo geyagye deka woje kponu la). <verse eid="COL 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 3:6" />Ikweyi kawoza mani, anya ko Owuso ya wa ikweyi kawase ni geyagye danu lo ni. <verse eid="COL 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 3:7" />Ishi oye ala ba yawoza mani, ipu ko olayi kala nekye. <verse eid="COL 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 3:8" />Anani oke wotiri ko yawoza mani kpiri shonu: anyakyokye, otuyoya, fokwunu, yasishi, kpela susu ko bose bwokwunu kala. <verse eid="COL 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 3:9" />Ala ka kokame diyikala lo, koni ala kwobonu yikpiye kala nekye kpo ozayoya nu ngma wa <verse eid="COL 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 3:10" />ala ki shikpiye pepe wa, ni kwikye wo pepe ipu ko gyogye ipu ko oyi ka Ase ni yo ni. <verse eid="COL 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 3:11" />Mani oni ela kase ni wo Oyahuda lo ni kwe ase ni wo Oyahuda yaba lo; ela kase ni shofu kwe ela kase ni shofu lo ni yaba lo; kase ni gwiyi kase ni gwiyi lo, ko oshe, kase ni yabo kiyinu, Okristi wo ojoji, kweyi ki yipu ko ojoji.<verse eid="COL 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 3:12" />Mani oni, ala wase ni Owuso shu, ase sere ni oyimu ni, ala shoshiye kiyinyinyi, kpotu neshi, kpi ikweyi bagye, kpo otumene ki kpo otuzoze. <verse eid="COL 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 3:13" />Ala gbotu kpi iyikala kweyi anya ni ala gbo kpi iyikala kpiri ala rigbiyi kala. Ala rigbiyi kala byoni Adole rigbala ni. <verse eid="COL 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 3:14" />Kweyi oni sharinya neshi mani kpiri ni, ala ki yimu yoya manu, imu ni kpuwa gbayi kpiri ipu ko dudu neshi ni. <verse eid="COL 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 3:15" />Ala yo omene ko Okristi na wo ose ipu kotu kala, byoni ala bipu kikpiye oye kponu ni ayalogwu gipu ko omene. Kweyi ala bi shotunehe. <verse eid="COL 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 3:16" />Ala yela ko Okristi na yagye ipu ka ala neneshi ishini ala ba fu ki ba diyikala ela kpo oziyi kpiri ni. Ala wigye ko Odawuda, kpi igye tota, kpi igye sere ko Owuso, kweyi ala wigye kpanu shotunehe do Owuso ipu ko otu kala. <verse eid="COL 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 3:17" />Kweyi oza ni ala ba ya kpiri, ipu kela koka kwe ipu ko za yoya, ala ya ipu ki iye ka Adole Oyesu, ba shotunehe do Owuso Ada iye bwebe nu.<verse eid="COL 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Owe ko Rema Ipu Ko olayi Pepe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 3:18" />Anya loba, ala geyagye dawobu kala, byoni oshoshi koya ipu ka Adole ni.<verse eid="COL 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="COL 3:19" />Awoba, ala yimu kanya kala kweyi ala ka yuwa jaja lo.<verse eid="COL 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="COL 3:20" />Ayi, oko kala yoma, ala faha kawa ada kpa awene kala ipu kojoji, koni osho Owuso otu mani.<verse eid="COL 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="COL 3:21" />Awada kpa awene, ala ka yotu kayi kala na bya lo, lalo ikpiye wa ya sha.<verse eid="COL 3:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="COL 3:22" />Awo oshe, ala faha kawa adole kala kikpiye ipu ko ojoji. Wa kishi ni iyi wa bi ikpiye kala kwe shini ala shuwotu lalo, ala ke ya kpotu oye kponu ki kpo oshi ka Adole. <verse eid="COL 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="COL 3:23" />Ojoji ni ala ba ya, ala yoko ipu nu kpo otu oyekponu, byala ba yoko da Adole la, wasuse lalo. <verse eid="COL 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="COL 3:24" />Koni ala gye mala ba wa rogwu bwebe ka Adole okwunu kabola kala. Adole Okristi pini ala ba gbeshe danu la. <verse eid="COL 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="COL 3:25" />Kpiri kase ni yobibi aba sanu ore kpo obibi nu, Owuso ya yimu kashe shashe ipu kepwo koka nu lo.<verse eid="COL 3:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="COL 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="COL 4:1" />Awadole, ala byawoshe kala neshi, ikweyi koni ala gye mala gba Adole mamani ipu ki iso.<verse eid="COL 4:1" /></para>
  <para style="s">Otugbagba Ikweyi ki Inarigu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="COL 4:2" />Ala hagye loshu ipu kinarigwu tota, kweyi bagye kpera ba shotunehe do Owuso. <verse eid="COL 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="COL 4:3" />Ala tinarigwu daha mamani, Owuso na gwowe doshu kaha, shini an tono koza teba ko Okristi, ni nyyo oruduru ikweyi nu mani. <verse eid="COL 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="COL 4:4" />Tinarigwu shini na tono nu neshi, byoni nshu ko ya ni. <verse eid="COL 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="COL 4:5" />Ala gbera kpoza ni ala ba ya kpase kese ni; yoko neshi kpishi kpiri ni ala pye ni. <verse eid="COL 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="COL 4:6" />Ela koka kala ishi kpiri na wela koneshi, ki lonye byonwa shini ala gishi ko kyogwu kela dananoho.<verse eid="COL 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ogbogba ko Gwejeji</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="COL 4:7" />Otayikyikwus ni woyene kaha moshi ni ya koshu kpiri ikweyi hin ya dala, owoya koko kaha ni ya yoko nu kwokwoshi ni, ki woye ipu kaha ayole ipu ka Adole. <verse eid="COL 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="COL 4:8" />Nyya toleho ebe kala shini ala gyoza ni aha bipu nu ni, shini ona ki talotugbagba. <verse eid="COL 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="COL 4:9" />Oya wa kpo Onesimus, oyene kaha moshi ni gbokwokwoshi, ni woye ipu kala ni. Aba kojoji niya gbodagye ebeni dala. <verse eid="COL 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="COL 4:10" />Aristakus, ni yoruduru kpami ni ya talogbogba, Omarkus oyene ko Obarnabas ya talogbogba mamani. Byoni nka dala ikweyi nu ni; owoni owebe kala, ala yomaba. <verse eid="COL 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="COL 4:11" />Ojoshuwa ni aba yogwu mo Oyustus ni ya talogbogba. Awa mani kin pi wa Ase ko Oyahuda ipu kase ni ba yoko kobula ko Owuso kpami ni la, kweyi ashinyi shosha shumotu kotata. <verse eid="COL 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="COL 4:12" />Epafara ni woye ipu kala kweyi ki woyole ko Okristi Oyesu ni ya talogbogba, Ishi kpiri oya takirikwu ipu kinarigwu tota dala, shini ala hagye giri ipu koza kpiri ni Owuso ya yimu ni, shini ala gye ki kyogwu otu oye kponu. <verse eid="COL 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="COL 4:13" />Nyyolobene nu moya yoko loshu dala kpawase ni bo Olawudikiya kpo Ohirapolis ni. <verse eid="COL 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="COL 4:14" />Oyene hin Oluka ni woloboshi ni kpo Odemas ba talogbogba. <verse eid="COL 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="COL 4:15" />Ala tayene ni bo Olawudikiya ni ogbogba dami, ala ki to Onimfa kpogbayi kayene ni bole nu ni ogbogba.<verse eid="COL 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="COL 4:16" />Ishini ala mokpa mani kweyi, ala toleho kpanu gogbayi kayene ko Olawudikiya shini ana ma. Kweyi ala ki molamu ni aba biwa bwo Olawudikiya ni.<verse eid="COL 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="COL 4:17" />Ala ka da Arkipus mo, &lt;&lt;Takirikwu shini oma mo oyoshishini koko ni adawo ipu ka Adole ni ya kweyi.&gt;&gt;<verse eid="COL 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="COL 4:18" />Ami Obulus togbogba mani abo hin. Ala ka nwanyi mo nyyo oruduru lo! Nyya beshi ko Owuso na yo kpala.<verse eid="COL 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="COL 4" />
</usx>